     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div><br></div><div>We&#39;ve tagged <a href=\"https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/releases/tag/v2.14.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/releases/tag/v2.14.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343005351000&amp;usg=AOvVaw31LOKPPWURc7u1ptZAHmEZ\">Stan v2.14.0</a> which fixes a critical bug in sampling. For more information, see: <a href=\"http://andrewgelman.com/2016/12/20/stan-2-10-stan-2-13-produce-biased-samples/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://andrewgelman.com/2016/12/20/stan-2-10-stan-2-13-produce-biased-samples/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343005351000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1-A4_P0eATub-JGkjqj7yG\">Stan 2.10 through Stan 2.13 produce biased samples</a> and <a href=\"http://andrewgelman.com/2016/12/21/michael-found-bug-stans-new-sampler/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://andrewgelman.com/2016/12/21/michael-found-bug-stans-new-sampler/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343005351000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3w9uyFTw3s4WGHAdCt1yz_\">Michael found the bug in Stan’s new sampler</a>. </div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/stan-dev/cmdstan/releases/tag/v2.14.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/stan-dev/cmdstan/releases/tag/v2.14.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343005351000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1sMwkuklk1jJKtqoUU0oGK\">CmdStan v2.14.0</a> is out now which includes Stan v2.14.0. If you&#39;re using an older version of CmdStan, please update immediately. This includes users of MatlabStan, Stan.jl, StataStan, and MathematicaStan.</div><div><br></div><div>RStan and PyStan will be updated soon. We will make announcements as soon as they are available.<br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">For the full release notes, see:</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><ul><li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span>CmdStan</span>: <a href=\"https://github.com/stan-dev/cmdstan/releases/tag/v2.14.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/stan-dev/cmdstan/releases/tag/v2.14.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343005351000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1sMwkuklk1jJKtqoUU0oGK\">https://github.com/<span>stan</span>-dev/<span>cmdstan</span>/releases/tag/<span>v2</span>.<span>14.</span>0</a></font></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span>Stan</span>: <a href=\"https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/releases/tag/v2.14.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/releases/tag/v2.14.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343005351000&amp;usg=AOvVaw31LOKPPWURc7u1ptZAHmEZ\">https://github.com/<span>stan</span>-dev/<span>stan</span>/releases/tag/<span>v2</span>.<span>1</span>4.0</a></font></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Math: <a href=\"https://github.com/stan-dev/math/releases/tag/v2.14.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/stan-dev/math/releases/tag/v2.14.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343005351000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1nUNxhdnj8IGTy6DZSS54w\">https://github.com/<span>stan</span>-dev/math/releases/tag/<span>v2</span>.14.0</a></font></li></ul></div></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Stan Development Team</div><div><br></div></div>\r\n"
